===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|material|}}, from {{der|en|la-lat|māteriālis}}, from {{der|en|la|māteria||wood, material, substance}}, from {{m|la|māter||mother}}. Displaced native {{ncog|enm|andweorc|andweorc, andwork|material, matter}} (from {{ncog|ang|andweorc||matter, substance, material}}). {{doublet|en|materiel}}.

